From 4be619c2cfc7088d86c28e830eb3c62643e25e3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:11:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ci(release): give the FreeBSD VM more memory; add a
 dispatch-only backfill workflow

The freebsd job of release.yml was killed with exit 137 while it built
boa_ast on v0.23.0. The VM had 5 GB. Raise it to 12 GB and build with
-j 2.

freebsd-backfill.yml builds the FreeBSD package of an existing vX.Y.0
tag and attaches it to that tag's release. It runs on workflow_dispatch
only. It never moves a tag and never replaces an asset.

Fixes #2378
Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
